      "writtenOn": "2019-03-13T22:44:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As of patchset 57, --iteflash_use_ftdi_with_servo_v2\u003dfalse is no longer experimental, it works including waveform generation.\n\nThe default is still \u003dtrue.",
      "parentUuid": "2bb631a3_f88e8436",
      "range": {
